%e A398484 Classifying the endomorphisms by the longest initial injective run, for n = 3:
%e A398484    9 [1|11, 1|12, 1|13, 2|21, 2|22, 2|23, 3|31, 3|32, 3|33];
%e A398484   12 [12|1, 12|2, 13|1, 13|3, 21|1, 21|2, 23|2, 23|3, 31|1, 31|3, 32|2, 32|3];
